12
00:00:34,290 --> 00:00:35,290
We are leaving

13
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:37,350
To avoid being discovered by these wind bugs

14
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:39,350
Go to the cliff

15
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:43,070
