26
00:01:15,460 --> 00:01:17,780
What's the point of revenge?

27
00:01:18,780 --> 00:01:19,780
Your Iron Hui Bird Army

28
00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:21,780
Sweeping away the territory of my Tanglang tribe

29
00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:22,780
Reciprocity

30
00:01:22,780 --> 00:01:27,390
Of course I have to take good care of you
